Output src/generated/multicursor_prefix.mp4
Require nvim

Hide
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Type "nvim --clean src/generated/multicursor_prefix.text"
Enter
Show

Ctrl+"v"
Type "2"
Type "j"
Type "I"
Type "f"
Type "r"
Type "u"
Type "i"
Type "t"
Type ":"
Type " "
Escape

Escape

Hide
Type ":w!"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2s